/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 62 0 R
/E ( It is a mechanism that takes a high-speed stream and distributes the 66-bit blocks round-robin across multiple parallel lanes to make physical transmission feasible.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
78 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 62 0 R
/E (The stream is physically split into 20 distinct hardware lanes. To correct physical cable delays \(skew\) and rebuild the data, Alignment Markers \(AMs\) are periodically injected directly into each lane's data path.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
79 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 62 0 R
/E (Lab Adaptation: To simplify simulation, the data travels in a single unified stream. The 20 physical paths are abstracted into Virtual Lanes using a sideband tag \(mld_lane_id\), and AMs are indicated by a parallel pulse \(mld_is_am\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
